2012-09-30 18:55:46	--	- MORGAN, RICHARD K. (1965-) is an English science fiction
2012-09-30 18:55:46	--	- author. Morgan's books are generally set in a dystopian world.
2012-09-30 18:55:46	--	- His breakout novel Altered Carbon won the Philip K. Dick Award,
2012-09-30 18:55:46	--	- and he has written many successful and amazing works to follow.
2012-09-30 18:55:46	--	- His more recent writings feature heavily on the theme of
2012-09-30 18:55:46	--	- autonomy in science fiction and escapism in fantasy.
